paired comparison, v0.5 against v0.9 on the same 120 cases
  unchanged cases carry no evidence about the change: 67
  fixed 45, broke 8; exact McNemar p = 2.4e-07
  a change that fixed 9 and broke 3: net 6 of 120, p = 0.15
  a change that fixed 7 and broke 1: net 6 of 120, p = 0.07

read 4 independent slices at the 5% level and at least one will look
significant about 19% of the time by chance alone
